  "description": "I met the naive me from 10 years ago. \n\n*“I will fix everything, our lives.”* \n\nKwon Ji-Jae ultimately chose to die at the age of 28 due to trauma from a past incident. However, when she came to his senses, she returned to the past 10 years ago, right before the terrible “event” occurred. She comes face to face with her younger self... can she be happy? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
